a('component description',r'\unsure{discrète|discrèt}; \unsure{composantes}; \inserted{A}; \deleted{\unsure{Pour Donc}}',r'discrète; compos.; A; \struck{Pour Donc}',r'discrète; composantes; \inserted{A}; \deleted{Pour Donc}','Terminal e of discrète and the continuation of composantes at the right edge are present; A is raised at the correction, while Pour Donc is struck below.','005_bottom.jpg','abbreviation expanded or spelling modernised','medium')
