save(5,t,R,[('text','opening','veut que si U est à la fois modéré fini'),('text','middle','à fortiori S∪T est partie finie modérée maximale'),('text','example introduction','Pour le formuler, on définit la'),('text','heading','Ex 1 structure de Réseau discrète'),('display','lower middle','S_0=P_2(L) ⇒ {Modf(L)=P_f(L), C_T=L\T}'),('display','lower','R_T=relation d’équivalence discrète; dot A=empty'),('text','bottom','Axiome Si T est partie finie modérée maximale'),('text','paper background','uncertain watermark')],['Cancelled parenthesis order after U retained; deux and telles resolved; first cancelled tout retained but the second was a drawing.','s/S retained; tt and looped L resolved; modér./modéré and punctuation after T retained.','Dots by S_0 retained as a doubt; plain P and dotted A resolved.','le and Réseau resolved; la/a retained; Déf resolved.','Argument L/L_0 and crossed Mod retained; crossed C(T) right side and hooked R subscript retained.','Ordinary R, discrète, composantes and Pour Donc resolved. Last adjective remains uncertain but no feminine e is supported; circumflex candidate added.','Watermark: uncertainty applies to whole candidate.'],'Whole image and both halves read; all cancellations, added finie, leader into the example heading and the small sketch were enlarged.')
